[{"title":"次韵友人游吴山别墅二首 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"主人开宴赏新晴，浓绿阴阴如水清。\n银瓮碧香浮臈味，锦笺绣句写春情。\n倚阑看尽先寻谱，扫石围棋默用兵。\n款客殷勤忘昼永，夕阳犹隔小溪明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17765,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和周山长别后见寄韵","author":"陈镒","text":"穷居彼此共栖迟，薄宦无成与愿违。\n白发五年愁避乱，青灯一夕喜论诗。\n雨凉吠蛤喧人耳，风定流萤入客衣。\n别后相思心独苦，犹怀把酒夜深时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17766,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"中秋对月次韵","author":"陈镒","text":"屡遭离乱奈愁何，对月今宵感慨歌。\n万里烟尘连紫塞，九天风露下银河。\n无人折桂当秋赏，有女乘鸾或夜过。\n岁岁青光只如旧，却怜白发满头多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17767,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上总制胡公次陈伯亮韵 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"安南上将喜来归，路入双溪暑气微。\n忧国半生心独苦，筹边三载盗应移。\n暂分外省纡华选，合向中朝侍衮衣。\n一道奎光照苍括，深山穷谷被馀辉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17768,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上总制胡公次陈伯亮韵 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"朱门画戟卫严居，瓯越民安绝吏渔。\n身佩龙泉三尺剑，家传豹略一编书。\n且须部列平沙幕，未许闲乘下泽车。\n白发小儒瞻望久，自怜尔雅注虫鱼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17769,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽李山甫教授","author":"陈镒","text":"避乱山中白发垂，近闻访旧入城池。\n芦花月淡人无处，桂子风凉雁过时。\n旅衬回程扶道左，举家迎哭向溪湄。\n他乡莫恨相知少，自有门生奠酒卮。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17770,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和叶仲和文学见寄韵","author":"陈镒","text":"马湖桥畔曾分手，五见凉风换葛衫。\n上国无媒干禄餋，北山小隐免林惭。\n石池乘月通泉水，苔径锄云种竹杉。\n多谢相知为相问，心閒日与野人谈。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17771,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵友人生日","author":"陈镒","text":"栝山隐士喜年高，点点霜华入鬓毛。\n云屋天香生古桂，霞杯春色映仙桃。\n翻经释子飞金策，称寿词人集褐袍。\n我亦知君眼如月，夜窗不厌看书劳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17772,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵友人游留此岩 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"今春曾作此岩游，花落山空水自流。\n到院怯逢僧定后，看云始悟此生浮。\n长松结子应千岁，老鹤生孙知几秋。\n尚忆个中风景好，何须海上觅蓬丘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17773,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵友人游留此岩 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"胜地何因得再游，石阑干外看飞流。\n青江树老霜华冷，金碧山空土气浮。\n清梵夜收僧步月，小亭昼坐客吟秋。\n知君独有林泉乐，我亦相将卜隐丘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17774,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵郑训导二首 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"幽人晓踏渡头沙，远趁闲云访我家。\n投老山中聊煮石，寻仙海上未乘槎。\n尊倾绿酒酬彭泽，盘饤黄柑擘永嘉。\n日短天寒年已暮，且看飞雪散琼花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17775,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵郑训导二首 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"一水回环漾浅沙，竹林深处老夫家。\n山童招鹤穿樵径，溪鸟窥鱼立钓槎。\n人得居闲心独静，诗因吟苦句方嘉。\n穷居渐觉回春意，檐外梅枝已着花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17776,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵叶训导元旦携诗见访","author":"陈镒","text":"苦吟诗客鬓苍华，又向东风试墨花。\n柏叶谩供新岁酒，竹门还访故人家。\n纷纷世事仍多患，落落吾生未有涯。\n溪上五年相伴住，钓竿随分占鸥沙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17777,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵叶文学立春日城回过访","author":"陈镒","text":"寒尽山城换历头，雪消春水满汀洲。\n梅花村外逢朋旧，竹叶尊前话客愁。\n直把诗书为活计，故应鱼鸟识风流。\n老来豪气犹如昨，共卧元龙百尺楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17778,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"郡中元夕次韵","author":"陈镒","text":"远水粼粼生浅洲，溪风吹月上城头。\n军中檛鼓春营宴，马上观灯夜市游。\n谁向昆崙重斫寨，独怀乡国谩登楼。\n凋零人物都非旧，赖有梅花慰客愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17779,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵友人郡中访旧","author":"陈镒","text":"春日泊舟城外川，故人相会问平安。\n十年牢落谋家苦，四海乱离行路难。\n旅馆青灯宵雨暗，战楼画角晚风寒。\n豪华往事谁能说，莫向尊前起浩叹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17780,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠医人冯英伯","author":"陈镒","text":"一别冯君今十载，重来犹带旧行囊。\n空窗灸艾消沈疾，新卷编蒲写秘方。\n阅世已经三折臂，忧时还转九回肠。\n餋生道要如相授，分我刀圭换鬓霜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17781,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次前韵答王子如","author":"陈镒","text":"秋日故人来野堂，生涯彼此一书囊。\n投闲已著归田录，餋老还求种树方。\n谩有篇诗酬逸兴，可无尊酒沃愁肠。\n白头乱后俱强健，却似黄花独耐霜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17782,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵齐子和山长过访","author":"陈镒","text":"竹外书斋午睡醒，忽惊有客扣门声。\n十年离乱成分首，一日相逢话别情。\n岁晚吾仍忧病肺，天寒君尚促行程。\n明朝又向山城去，满路梅花入品评。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17783,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉和王宪使贺总制胡公得平阳诗韵","author":"陈镒","text":"平阳一旦送降旗，大将威名众所知。\n聚石江流分八阵，通途海国绝他岐。\n许君剑在蛟须斩，韩子文成鳄定移。\n盖世功勋垂不朽，绣衣使者著声诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17784,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山行至桐川会周山长","author":"陈镒","text":"遥望长松何处是，深山犹认旧川原。\n行程客厌阑干路，生事农忙碌碡村。\n若个峰边云出没，丛生树外月黄昏。\n武昌诗客欣相会，夜向溪轩共一尊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17785,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"五月二十四日游平山庵客怀豁然用前韵呈周济川叶诚中","author":"陈镒","text":"一庵潇洒何年构，半近青山半近原。\n群木丛中留古冢，小轩明处见孤村。\n灶烧落叶茶烟湿，门掩苍云竹日昏。\n羡尔主宾无个事，晚凉堂上注芳尊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17786,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"欲至松学连日阻雨再用韵奉简诸友","author":"陈镒","text":"欲访蟾峰虽咫尺，潇潇风雨隔平原。\n故人只在松边馆，倦客空吟竹外村。\n两处离怀溪水阔，一襟幽思岭云昏。\n旧栽青杏今何似，想见阴浓覆酒尊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17787,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寿蔡伯玉隐居","author":"陈镒","text":"故人年长周花甲，啸咏溪山乐有馀。\n世隐一区杨子宅，家藏万卷邺侯书。\n歌姬拥座飞琼斝，贺客盈门集翠裾。\n最好联魁堂下桂，年年开占月明初。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17788,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"八月三日伯玉留饮西涧别馆二首 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"前年避乱此山中，今日还来访隐翁。\n山色入楼帘捲雨，水声落涧坐生风。\n身安畎亩如庞老，妓拥登临拟谢公。\n筵客殷勤到曛黑，酒酣携手石梁东。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17789,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"八月三日伯玉留饮西涧别馆二首 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"忆昔遨游湖海中，只今华发总成翁。\n诗词仿古多唐体，人物居闲有晋风。\n且把酒杯酬地主，莫将世事问天公。\n何当结屋来相傍，坐听松风涧水东。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17790,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"同孙伯起游留此岩再用前韵","author":"陈镒","text":"偶来听瀑此岩中，藜杕相随只两翁。\n凉气着衣梧叶雨，秋香薰路桂花风。\n洞幽僧礼白毫相，潭净鱼游赤鲩公。\n坐久石坛林影乱，斜阳归踏小桥东。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17791,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵周山长见寄","author":"陈镒","text":"久客松州生有涯，青山无价尽堪赊。\n苦吟只为酬诗债，薄俸多应付酒家。\n十载风尘双短屐，半生江海一浮槎。\n如今老去宜谋隐，静阅丹书忆少霞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17792,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题何子远典史诗卷","author":"陈镒","text":"风尘十载共飘零，湖海空留漫浪名。\n君为奉亲辞薄宦，我因归计识勤耕。\n天机衮衮青春去，世事纭纭白发生。\n好向溪头理渔艇，绿波烟雨结鸥盟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17793,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵祝公亮经历见寄","author":"陈镒","text":"辞官陶令归来久，我亦居山结草堂。\n乱后病怀惟药裹，老来活计祇诗囊。\n曾陪古寺看脩竹，忽见春风绽野棠。\n但愿此身强健在，岁寒松柏共苍苍。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17794,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵伯玉隐君大方上人过访","author":"陈镒","text":"地僻深门傍竹开，一溪流水碧于苔。\n云边煮茗延僧坐，石上留棋迟客来。\n白社闲居宜老境，青云阔步属英才。\n艰难世故犹如此，且共筵前有限杯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17795,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游南明山次周子符韵","author":"陈镒","text":"萧萧落叶委空山，幽磴添苔护石阑。\n一自三平骑虎去，至今龛洞白云寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17796,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再次韵答海翁上人 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"为爱石梁担负山，照心亭上久凭阑。\n松篁不动云飞尽，清磬一声山月寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17797,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再次韵答海翁上人 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"红尘飞不到青山，留得诗人倚石阑。\n林鹤已归僧未返，半岩秋雨瀑花寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17798,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜泊桐江","author":"陈镒","text":"柂牙伊轧涛惊枕，船腹凄凉月射窗。\n正是客愁无处着，数声寒雁起沧江。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17799,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客枕","author":"陈镒","text":"满城风露气漫漫，钟鼓声中漏欲乾。\n梦觉忽惊身是客，半檐残月五更寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17800,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"重游南山二老亭回望前朝大臣故冢","author":"陈镒","text":"前朝文物已凋零，感慨重登二老亭。\n荒冢尚留翁仲守，百年松柏自青青。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17801,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过溪居次韵","author":"陈镒","text":"玉溪溪上晚春馀，凉樾苍藤日影疏。\n闲傍竹门南畔过，石阑阴处看鯈鱼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17802,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客中见菊","author":"陈镒","text":"病骨惊寒欲授衣，年来身世更支离。\n菊花相见浑如旧，何事诗人鬓易衰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17803,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"同友人游龙台山胜因寺","author":"陈镒","text":"三枝藜杖陟秋冈，风露初交野菊香。\n行到胜因钟巳午，坐延松影过回廊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17804,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游清福寺","author":"陈镒","text":"昨日胜因扶杖去，今朝清福驾舟来。\n老禅迎客长松下，闲对黄花扫碧苔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17805,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"独坐","author":"陈镒","text":"一炷沈烟百虑清，殊方十月早寒生。\n蒲团竹几西窗坐，閒听西风送雨声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17806,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"古断肠曲","author":"陈镒","text":"花落长门日易昏，不因芳草为销魂。\n玉阑干外东风过，吹落罘罳月一痕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17807,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再游南明寺和旧题韵","author":"陈镒","text":"十载无因到此山，满阶苔色上层阑。\n堂中禅老眉如雪，独与青松耐岁寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17808,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"村景 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"阴阴桑柘雨初晴，一片平田白水生。\n野老相逢无别事，共过深巷听鹂鹒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17809,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"村景 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"屋后青山屋外溪，穿芳度密有深蹊。\n白云不隔经行处，容我时来寄杖藜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17810,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"得张脩撰书","author":"陈镒","text":"一冬卧病才方愈，清晓开门起看梅。\n野服忽然逢驿使，翰林脩撰寄书来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17811,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题松竹梅图","author":"陈镒","text":"一树梅花两个松，数竿脩竹共清风。\n生来不作趍炎态，岁晚相看冰雪中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17812,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜饮月波堂","author":"陈镒","text":"花影当帘春夜长，主人迎客月波堂。\n深情得似深杯量，消尽铜匜一篆香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17813,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵题江山小景二扇面 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"漠漠风烟溯碧流，荻花摇荡一江秋。\n渔舟遥系人家外，短笛数声生晚愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17814,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵题江山小景二扇面 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"江上数峰凝紫烟，江头一水碧于天。\n月华明处秋空阔，疑有缑山驾鹤仙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17815,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题阎仲彬墨菊","author":"陈镒","text":"采采秋花不自持，黄裳正色变缁衣。\n江南江北风尘暗，三径凄迷何处归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17816,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题美人背面欠伸图","author":"陈镒","text":"东风背立好腰肢，脉脉含情睡起时。\n若使画工开正面，罗虬应不咏红儿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17817,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客中雪夕","author":"陈镒","text":"冻云黯淡连江树，东望家乡缈何处。\n偶沽斗酒聊为欢，闭门风雪千山暮。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17818,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"渔父","author":"陈镒","text":"短篷烟雨泊鸥沙，剩有鱼钱到酒家。\n近日人间多赋敛，争如水国作生涯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17819,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"余患肺病徐子苍寄诗问安次韵答之 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"径竹猗猗绿似云，满阶凉影石苔新。\n故人远寄相思句，应念山中老病身。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17820,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"余患肺病徐子苍寄诗问安次韵答之 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"深巷沈沈白昼间，一区林屋自清宽。\n业多尚觉身为患，虑遣应无心可安。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17821,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵听竹亭","author":"陈镒","text":"乘闲来坐此君亭，潇洒惟便客子情。\n门外黄尘深没马，谁知此地自秋声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17822,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜起","author":"陈镒","text":"县斋静夜秋风起，落叶萧萧扑窗纸。\n酒醒疑是山雨来，月明满地凉如水。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17823,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宿蟾峰","author":"陈镒","text":"湖上蟾峰镇碧波，万家高倚石嵯峨。\n我来却值秋初霁，快睹中天月色多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17824,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游南岩三首 其一 天池","author":"陈镒","text":"步上岩头路百盘，石梁霜叶满阑干。\n白牛卧处云飞尽，惟见天池一镜寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17825,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游南岩三首 其二 抱膝亭","author":"陈镒","text":"白云深处启重扃，一径斜通抱膝亭。\n北郭战尘吹不到，老僧犹指树青青。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17826,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游南岩三首 其三 妙高台","author":"陈镒","text":"妙高台在诸天上，如入如来不二门。\n欲把一言参妙处，是心默契己忘言。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17827,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三月十日游南明照心亭和旧题诗韵","author":"陈镒","text":"曾题诗句在名山，感慨重来倚石阑。\n三十年馀僧自老，空留池水照心寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17828,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉和刘伯温员外漫兴诗韵并自述一十五首 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"苍岭愁云树压低，青田明月鹤高栖。\n也知天庇神仙境，秋色依然满好溪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17829,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d